OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785444469
OL,3,CInterest rates held at 3.75% as Bank
OL,4,Cof England warns of inflation rise
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe Bank has predicted that households
OL,12,Fwill see a marginal rise in energy
OL,13,Fbills from October due to a new energy
OL,14,Fprice cap.
OL,16,FIn July the price cap rose to #1,663
OL,17,Ffor the annual electricity bill of a
OL,18,Ftypical household. This is expected to
OL,19,Fincrease to #1,680 in October, the
OL,20,FBank said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785444469
OL,3,CInterest rates held at 3.75% as Bank
OL,4,Cof England warns of inflation rise
OL,6,FIt added that this is around #45 lower
OL,7,Fthan would have been the case without
OL,8,Fthe Government's decision to
OL,9,Ftemporarily remove VAT on household
OL,10,Felectricity bills.
OL,12,FThe move is expected to have knocked
OL,13,F0.1 percentage points off the
OL,14,Finflation rate in the second half of
OL,15,Fthis year.
OL,17,FThe Bank also cautioned that a memory
OL,18,Fchip supply shortage, linked to high
OL,19,Fdemand from the AI sector, could also
OL,20,Fadd to inflation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
