FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785444469
OL,3,CInterest rates held at 3.75% as Bank
OL,4,Cof England warns of inflation rise
OL,6,FThe shortage is expected to push
OL,7,Ftechnology prices higher and therefore
OL,8,F"add a little over 0.1 percentage
OL,9,Fpoints to UK consumer price inflation"
OL,10,Fby the end of the year.
OL,12,FFood inflation has slowed in recent
OL,13,Fmonths but is expected to swing higher
OL,14,Fagain, to nearly 3.5% by the end of
OL,15,Fthe year, although this is weaker than
OL,16,Fprevious estimates.
OL,26,@pD@AOUqD@fO]
