PN,31508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785444469
OL,3,CInterest rates held at 3.75% as Bank
OL,4,Cof England warns of inflation rise
OL,6,FThe rise in food prices is linked to
OL,7,Fhigher energy bills for food producers
OL,8,Fand supply issues caused by hot and
OL,9,Fdry conditions linked to the El Nino
OL,10,Fweather phenomenon.
OL,12,FMeanwhile, the Bank also suggested
OL,13,Fthat the UK economy is likely to grow
OL,14,Fby 1.1% both this year and next year
OL,15,Fin its central forecast.
OL,17,FIt points to a slightly stronger
OL,18,Foutlook after the Bank previously
OL,19,Fpointed to 0.8% growth in 2026 in its
OL,20,Fprevious full projections in April.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
