PN,31509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785444469
OL,3,CInterest rates held at 3.75% as Bank
OL,4,Cof England warns of inflation rise
OL,6,FThe picture for unemployment is also
OL,7,Fslightly improved, with the Bank
OL,8,Fsuggesting this will reach 5.3% next
OL,9,Fyear, having predicted it could be
OL,10,F5.5% in 2027 in its most positive
OL,11,Fprojection from April.
OL,13,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,14,Four political experts are across all
OL,15,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,16,Fto the latest episode below...
